# Files that live in the repo but are not part of the website.
#
# Vercel serves every deployed file at its own URL, so without this list
# anyone could download /scripts/harvest-emails.js or the note-review drafts
# straight off grownandmade.uk. Being public on GitHub is one thing; being
# served from the site as if it were part of it is another.
#
# Keep in mind before adding a line: the functions in api/ need
# scripts/lib/ (geo.js requires uk-regions.js) and data/businesses.json
# (ai-search.js reads it at start-up), and the pages need data/uk-coast.json.
# The patterns below only match files directly inside scripts/ and data/.

# Tooling
/scripts/*.js
/scripts/*.py
/scripts/templates

# Pipeline intermediates and internal reports
/data/*.md
/data/product-index*.json
/data/audience-index.json
/data/public-note-drafts.json

# Notes, snippets and the old landing prototype
/*.md
/_footer.html
/landing-prototype.html
/data/prototype-data.js
/exports
